%% sequence.mmd - Diagrama de secuencia: petición para obtener múltiples capas simultáneamente

sequenceDiagram
  participant Front as Unreal Front
  participant Ctrl as REST Controller
  participant Svc as LayerService
  participant API as WeatherApiClient
  participant Factory as LayerFactory
  participant Strat as LayerStrategy

  Front->>Ctrl: GET /layers?layers=wind,temperature&heights=100,200&location=LAT,LON
  Ctrl->>Svc: getLayers(requestParams)  %% requestParams contiene lista de capas y alturas
  Svc->>API: fetchWeatherData(location, timeWindow)
  API-->>Svc: rawWeatherData
  note right of Svc: Por cada capa solicitada, se elige una estrategia y se construye el modelo

  par Build wind layer
    Svc->>Factory: getStrategyFor(type=wind, height=100)
    Factory-->>Svc: WindStrategy
    Svc->>Strat: WindStrategy.buildLayer(rawWeatherData, height=100)
    Strat-->>Svc: LayerModel(type=wind, height=100)
  and Build temperature layer
    Svc->>Factory: getStrategyFor(type=temperature, height=200)
    Factory-->>Svc: TemperatureStrategy
    Svc->>Strat: TemperatureStrategy.buildLayer(rawWeatherData, height=200)
    Strat-->>Svc: LayerModel(type=temperature, height=200)
  end

  Svc-->>Ctrl: [LayerModel(...), LayerModel(...)]  %% Array JSON con todas las capas
  Ctrl-->>Front: 200 OK (Array de LayerModels)
